{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_21","type":"agent_message","text":"The mismatch came from LLVM rewriting one subtraction as an addition with a negated constant, which can change NaN sign bits. I’m isolating the single-precision arithmetic steps so the generated operations line up with the C expression order more closely."}}
